j<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 278 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3444 0 obj<</A 3445 0 R/Next 3442 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3446 0 R/Title(6. The area shall then be irrigated for a minimum of 14 days to encourage growth of any remaining plant material and germination of weed seed lying dormant in the topsoil.)>>endobj3445 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 320 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3446 0 obj<</A 3447 0 R/Next 3444 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3448 0 R/Title(5. Power rake or verticut the entire area to loosen residual plant debris, taking care not to disturb the headstone support systems where noted to be protected.  Remove plant debris and dispose of legally off site.)>>endobj3447 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 361 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3448 0 obj<</A 3449 0 R/Next 3446 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3450 0 R/Title(4. Follow product label instructions for elapsed time before moving to the next procedure to allow the herbicides to fully affect the plant material.)>>endobj3449 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 389 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3450 0 obj<</A 3451 0 R/Next 3448 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3452 0 R/Title(3. Application rate shall be at the maximum label recommended rate for the complete kill of the existing turfgrass, Poa annua, sedges and other weeds.)>>endobj3451 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 430 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3452 0 obj<</A 3453 0 R/Next 3450 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3454 0 R/Title(2. After the preparatory mowings, while the turf is still actively growing, the entire vegetated area must be sprayed with non-selective and selective herbicides, taking care to avoid drift of herbicides onto adjacent vegetation to be protected.)>>endobj3453 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 485 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3454 0 obj<</A 3455 0 R/Next 3452 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3456 0 R/Title(1. First application:  Do not turn off the irrigation system until just before the application of the herbicides.  This will allow the turf to absorb the maximum amount of herbicide.  Tank-mix herbicides following precautions of herbicide manufacturers.)>>endobj3455 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 541 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3456 0 obj<</A 3457 0 R/Next 3454 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3458 0 R/Title(C. Herbicide Application:  Apply herbicide in a minimum of TWO APPLICATIONS in the sequence indicated below.)>>endobj3457 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 568 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3458 0 obj<</A 3459 0 R/Next 3456 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3460 0 R/Title(B. Protection of Headstones:  Ensure that the work involved for vegetation removal does not cause the headstones to be shifted out of alignment or moved from their sockets.  Any misalignment of headstones must be corrected by the Contractor at no addi...)>>endobj3459 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 637 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3460 0 obj<</A 3461 0 R/Next 3458 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3462 0 R/Title(A. General:  Remove turfgrass sod, weeds and their roots from within limits of work area.  Cut a clean line between sod to be removed and sod in adjacent cemetery sections to be retained.)>>endobj3461 0 obj<</D[1981 0 R/XYZ 88 692 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3462 0 obj<</A 3463 0 R/Next 3460 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3464 0 R/Title(2. Prior to installing sod, demonstrate to the COR that the irrigation zone to receive sod is fully functional from the irrigation controller.  Sod installation must be sequenced to conform to existing irrigation zones, such that sod is laid in areas ...)>>endobj3463 0 obj<</D[1980 0 R/XYZ 88 182 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3464 0 obj<</A 3465 0 R/Next 3462 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3466 0 R/Title(1. Any damage to the irrigation system caused by the Contractor must be repaired by the Contractor prior to sod installation at no additional cost to the Government.)>>endobj3465 0 obj<</D[1980 0 R/XYZ 88 223 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3466 0 obj<</A 3467 0 R/Next 3464 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3468 0 R/Title(D. Testing and Repair)>>endobj3467 0 obj<</D[1980 0 R/XYZ 88 237 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj3468 0 obj<</A 3469 0 R/Next 3466 0 R/Parent 3377 0 R/Prev 3470 